"ちょっと気を許してしまった結果、幸光のオナネタにされてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そして、自らの欲求不満、若い奏たちへの対抗心から関係を継続する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「仕方ないでしょう。女だって、こんなにエッチなものをいっぱい見てたら、ムラムラするわよ」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"67817"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/884adc4f22ad7579d717050faac55355f15957857b997f02d88c31151a887270.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/87/879d5dd944454aedd1d1b9ad8af3a6f09bdd873d9109d1250d94c95679f03e0b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"八ッ橋きなこ","creatorId":"vndb:s353","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s353","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s353","name":"八ッ橋きなこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:267570:67817:16170:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c78578","characterName":"間宮 幸光","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c78578"},"originalCharacterName":"間宮 幸光","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"actors":[]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p8591","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:5926","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p8591","name":"Hending","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:27494:5926","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p8591","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p8591","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p8591","name":"Hending","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:68696:v24728","source":"vndb"},{"companyId":"vndb:p8591","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p8591","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p8591","name":"Hending","roleCodes":["developer","publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-